{
  "$schema": "./schema.json",
  "name": "project-files",
  "feature": "project.save",
  "description": "One self-contained project file for the whole working document. A new animation Mine/Hop gets a key at frame 0 with the root at [0, 0, 1] and one at frame 10 with the root at [0.2, 0, 1.1]; a link layer plays the built-in Locomotion/Walk on the upper body; a scene box Step (1 x 0.5 m, top 0.3 m); the AI settings have trajectory 0.5 and head 0.25; the left arm is locked, wrist.L pinned; the playhead sits at frame 4. project.save writes it: 2 clips (Hop and the embedded Walk), the document is now the project's (editor.state: no library id, the project path, nothing unsaved). After session.reset, project.open brings everything back: 11 frames, the playhead at 4, 2 layers, 1 box, version 1 and no migration; the sampled roots at frames 0 and 10 are the keyed ones, the box, the link (not missing: it plays the embedded clip, no library needed), the settings, the lock and the pin all read back. Saving again gives the very same bytes: the two saves and project.info report one hash (pinned: a content hash can't be worked by hand; the check is that the three agree). Migration: fixtures/data/project-v0.project.json is a hand-written version-0 file (identity rotations throughout; links as a [{id, clip}] list, the playhead as `playhead`, no ai block): project.info reads its version 0 (not current); project.open migrates it (`migrated`), the playhead at 7, keys at 0 and 20 with the roots [0, 0, 1] and [1, 0, 1] interpolated linearly, so frame 10 samples [0.5, 0, 1]; its Ledge box spans [-1, -1]..[1, 0] (centre [0, -0.5], top 0.4), its link Mine/Base is embedded, the AI settings are the defaults. Undo takes the migrated project back off: the Hop project is open again as it was (playhead 4, the lock and the pin). The session is then reset, so the refusals below run on a fresh document. Refused, with the document unchanged: a missing file, a rig file (not a project), a corrupt one (a clip with one bone and a 3-number rotation), one written by a newer version (99), and a save with no path when the document has no project file.",
  "script": [
    {
      "command": "clip.new",
      "params": {
        "name": "Hop",
        "group": "Mine"
      },
      "expect": {
        "id": "Mine/Hop"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "pose.set_root",
      "params": {
        "root": [
          0,
          0,
          1
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "key.set",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "frame.set",
      "params": {
        "frame": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "pose.set_root",
      "params": {
        "root": [
          0.2,
          0,
          1.1
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "key.set",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "layer.add",
      "params": {
        "source": "link",
        "link": "Locomotion/Walk",
        "parts": [
          "Upper body"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "surface.add",
      "params": {
        "name": "Step",
        "width": 1,
        "depth": 0.5,
        "top": 0.3
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "ai.settings",
      "params": {
        "trajectory": 0.5,
        "head": 0.25
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "parts.lock",
      "params": {
        "parts": [
          "Left arm"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "pin.set",
      "params": {
        "bone": "wrist.L"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "frame.set",
      "params": {
        "frame": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.save",
      "params": {
        "path": "{tmp}/hop.project.json"
      },
      "expect": {
        "links": [
          "Locomotion/Walk"
        ],
        "clips": 2,
        "hash": "c8591468c957e18c"
      },
      "pinned": "the hash of the file's bytes; the same hash below proves the second save is byte-identical"
    },
    {
      "command": "editor.state",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "id": null,
        "unsaved": false,
        "frame": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "session.reset",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "editor.state",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "length": 0,
        "project": null
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{tmp}/hop.project.json"
      },
      "expect": {
        "name": "Hop",
        "length": 11,
        "frame": 4,
        "links": [
          "Locomotion/Walk"
        ],
        "layers": 2,
        "boxes": 1,
        "version": 1,
        "migrated": false,
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "clip.sample",
      "params": {
        "from": 0,
        "to": 10,
        "step": 10
      },
      "expect": {
        "frames": [
          0,
          10
        ],
        "roots": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            0.2,
            0,
            1.1
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "layers.list",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "layers": [
          {
            "i": 0,
            "name": "Base",
            "source": "keys",
            "keys": 2
          },
          {
            "i": 1,
            "name": "Walk",
            "source": "link",
            "link": "Locomotion/Walk",
            "part": "Upper body",
            "missing": false
          }
        ],
        "surfaces": [
          {
            "name": "Step",
            "top": 0.3,
            "turn": 0
          }
        ],
        "physics": true
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "ai.settings",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "style": "any",
        "style_force": 1,
        "ai_force": 1,
        "trajectory": 0.5,
        "head": 0.25
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "editor.state",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "name": "Hop",
        "group": "Mine",
        "id": null,
        "unsaved": false,
        "frame": 4,
        "locked": [
          "Left arm"
        ],
        "pins": [
          "wrist.L"
        ],
        "edit_layer": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.save",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "links": [
          "Locomotion/Walk"
        ],
        "clips": 2,
        "hash": "c8591468c957e18c"
      },
      "pinned": "the same hash as the first save: byte-identical"
    },
    {
      "command": "project.info",
      "params": {
        "path": "{tmp}/hop.project.json"
      },
      "expect": {
        "version": 1,
        "current": true,
        "name": "Hop",
        "group": "Mine",
        "fps": 30,
        "frames": 11,
        "layers": 2,
        "boxes": 1,
        "links": [
          "Locomotion/Walk"
        ],
        "clips": 2,
        "hash": "c8591468c957e18c"
      },
      "pinned": "the same hash again"
    },
    {
      "command": "project.info",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/../fixtures/data/project-v0.project.json"
      },
      "expect": {
        "version": 0,
        "current": false,
        "name": "Old",
        "fps": 24,
        "frames": 21,
        "layers": 2,
        "boxes": 1,
        "links": [
          "Mine/Base"
        ],
        "clips": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/../fixtures/data/project-v0.project.json"
      },
      "expect": {
        "name": "Old",
        "length": 21,
        "frame": 7,
        "links": [
          "Mine/Base"
        ],
        "layers": 2,
        "boxes": 1,
        "version": 0,
        "migrated": true,
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "clip.sample",
      "params": {
        "from": 0,
        "to": 20,
        "step": 10
      },
      "expect": {
        "frames": [
          0,
          10,
          20
        ],
        "roots": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            0.5,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            1,
            0,
            1
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "layers.list",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "layers": [
          {
            "i": 0,
            "name": "Base",
            "keys": 2
          },
          {
            "i": 1,
            "name": "Base link",
            "source": "link",
            "link": "Mine/Base",
            "missing": false
          }
        ],
        "surfaces": [
          {
            "name": "Ledge",
            "min": [
              -1,
              -1
            ],
            "max": [
              1,
              0
            ],
            "centre": [
              0,
              -0.5
            ],
            "top": 0.4,
            "turn": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "ai.settings",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "style": "any",
        "style_force": 1,
        "ai_force": 1,
        "trajectory": 0,
        "head": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "editor.state",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "name": "Old",
        "frame": 7,
        "locked": [
          "Left arm"
        ],
        "pins": [],
        "unsaved": false
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "edit.undo",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "command": "project.open"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "editor.state",
      "params": {},
      "expect": {
        "name": "Hop",
        "length": 11,
        "frame": 4,
        "locked": ["Left arm"],
        "pins": ["wrist.L"]
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "session.reset",
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "tolerance": 1e-9
  },
  "errors": [
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{tmp}/nowhere.project.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/rig/default_rig.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/../fixtures/data/project-corrupt.project.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.open",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/../fixtures/data/project-future.project.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.info",
      "params": {
        "path": "{assets}/../fixtures/data/project-future.project.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.info",
      "params": {
        "path": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "project.save",
      "params": {}
    }
  ]
}
